Where the knowledge came from
-----------------------------

Gadgetbridge (https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge), AGPL-3.0-or-later.
  The Zepp OS protocol this app speaks (the B-163 ECDH handshake, chunked framing and
  encryption, activity fetch, and the alarm and config service layouts) was learned from
  Gadgetbridge's source. An earlier app ported it; this one re-implements it from
  docs/spec/01-strap-protocol.md, with test vectors, and copies no Gadgetbridge code (D8).
  Licensing this project under the AGPL keeps it compatible with that lineage.

HelioCore: read as a protocol reference only; no code taken.

huami_token: read as the reference for the Zepp cloud sign-in request that
  tools/keyfetch sends; no code taken.


